{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>ואסלדה</b> — like <i>ביצה סלודה</i> (a roasted egg), and it is a metaphor for the intensity of the pain. And the wonder is that He would not show pity, though I did not conceal His words, and I have no help from myself. And I have seen Rabbenu Hai of blessed memory, who interpreted: <b>ואסלדה</b>, in the sense of lifting up."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:01:56.108230313Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}